  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"page\"> <p><a href=\"#content\">Skip to content</a></p><header id=\"masthead\" role=\"banner\"> <div> <div> <p><a href=\"https://om.co/\" rel=\"home\" itemprop=\"url\"><img width=\"164\" height=\"72\" src=\"https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om.png\" alt=\"Site Logo for om.co\" data-size=\"resonar-logo\" itemprop=\"logo\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om.png 164w, https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om-164x72.png 300w, https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om-48x21-48x21.png 48w, https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om-150x66.png 150w, https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om-100x44.png 100w, https://om.co/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/logo-om-141x62.png 141w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 164px) 100vw, 164px\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://om.co/\" rel=\"home\">On my Om</a></p> <p>Technology &amp; Change: Field Notes From The Present Future</p> </div><!-- .site-branding --> <div> <nav id=\"site-navigation\" role=\"navigation\"> <div id=\"menu-navigation\"> <ul id=\"menu-header-navigation\"><li id=\"menu-item-947346\"><a href=\"https://om.co/about/\">About Om</a></li>\n<li><span id=\"search-toggle\"><span>Search</span></span></li></ul> </div> </nav>\n\t</div> <!--<button id=\"sidebar-toggle\" class=\"sidebar-toggle\"></button>--> <!-- <button id=\"menu-toggle\" class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-controls=\"header-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" title=\"Toggle Menu\"></button> --> </div><!-- .site-header-main -->\n\t</header><!-- .site-header --> <div id=\"content\"> <main id=\"main\" role=\"main\"> <!-- .entry-date -->\n\t<header> </header>\n<div> <p>Om Malik passed away on June 24, 2026, at Stanford Hospital after a long health journey with his heart. He was surrounded by family and friends.</p> <p>We invite you to share your remembrances of Om in the comments below or by posting and tagging his accounts on <a href=\"https://x.com/om\">X/Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/om/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@om\">Threads</a>, or <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ommalik/\">LinkedIn</a>.</p> <p>To learn more about Om’s life and work, you can visit <a href=\"https://om.co/about/\">his About page</a> or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Om_Malik\">read more on Wikipedia</a>.</p> <p>— Om’s Family</p>\n\t</div> <div id=\"block-61\">\n\t<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f962dea24b9cd80f140b607a2550353e20784af6da351e17b774daa2e231996b?s=128&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f962dea24b9cd80f140b607a2550353e20784af6da351e17b774daa2e231996b?s=256&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g 2x\" height=\"128\" width=\"128\">\t</p><!-- .author-avatar --> <p> <strong>Om Malik</strong> is a San Francisco based writer, photographer and investor. <a href=\"https://om.co/about/\"><strong>Read More</strong></a> <a href=\"https://om.co/author/om/\" rel=\"author\"> </a> </p><!-- .author-description -->\n</div> <div id=\"comments\"> <h2> 2 thoughts on this post\t\t</h2> <ol> <li id=\"comment-189273\"> <article id=\"div-comment-189273\"> <!-- .comment-meta --> <div> <p>My condolences to family and friends. I’ve been reading Om’s blog for years and always enjoyed his insight, and especially his interweaved creative endeavors. His photography has always been striking. He’ll be missed.</p> </div><!-- .comment-content --> </article><!-- .comment-body --> </li><!-- #comment-## --> <li id=\"comment-189275\"> <article id=\"div-comment-189275\"> <!-- .comment-meta --> <div> <p>I didn’t know Om well, but I savored my encounters with him, the last of which was a year ago at WWDC. He had been doing the best writing of his life in recent months on this site, and in his absence, we will all understand the tech industry a little less well. I’m so very sorry.</p> </div><!-- .comment-content --> </article><!-- .comment-body --> </li><!-- #comment-## --> </ol><!-- .comment-list --> <div id=\"respond\"> <h3 id=\"reply-title\">Leave a Reply <small></small></h3>\t</div><!-- #respond -->\n\t<p>This site uses Akismet to reduce spam. <a href=\"https://akismet.com/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Learn how your comment data is processed.</a></p>\n</div><!-- .comments-area -->\n\n<nav aria-label=\"Posts\">\n\t<h2>Post navigation</h2> </nav> </main><!-- .site-main --> </div><!-- .site-content --> <!-- .site-footer -->\n</div></div>",
